{:edb/db-before-t 476 :edb/db-after-t 477 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533789 50 #inst "2026-10-04T23:51:09.496Z" 13194139533789 true] [17592186179714 1020 #edb/ref 17592186251280 13194139533789 true] [17592186179714 1020 #edb/ref 17592186251300 13194139533789 true] [17592186179714 1020 #edb/ref 17592186251304 13194139533789 true] [17592186179714 1020 #edb/ref 17592186251311 13194139533789 true] [17592186179714 1020 #edb/ref 17592186251325 13194139533789 true] [17592186179715 1020 #edb/ref 17592186251273 13194139533789 true] [17592186179715 1020 #edb/ref 17592186251283 13194139533789 true] [17592186179715 1020 #edb/ref 17592186251287 13194139533789 true] [17592186179715 1020 #edb/ref 17592186251318 13194139533789 true] [17592186179715 1020 #edb/ref 17592186251332 13194139533789 true] [17592186179716 1020 #edb/ref 17592186251252 13194139533789 true] [17592186179716 1020 #edb/ref 17592186251259 13194139533789 true] [17592186179716 1020 #edb/ref 17592186251266 13194139533789 true] [17592186179716 1020 #edb/ref 17592186251290 13194139533789 true] [17592186179716 1020 #edb/ref 17592186251293 13194139533789 true] [17592186251252 1017 #edb/ref 17592186251253 13194139533789 true] [17592186251252 1089 "q-100471" 13194139533789 true] [17592186251252 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533789 true] [17592186251252 1100 "Find the solution of ${3}^{x+5}={7}^{6-2x}.$" 13194139533789 true] [17592186251252 1113 #uuid "dcbfd20b-f656-5999-870b-b45683d40339" 13194139533789 true] [17592186251252 1145 "First, we take the natural logarithm $(ln)$ of both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{3}^{x+5} & ={7}^{6-2x} \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡({3}^{x+5}) & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡({7}^{6-2x})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we use the power law of logarithms to simplify both sides of the equation. This gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x+5)\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3) & =(6-2x)\\operatorname{ln}⁡(7)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we solve for $x$, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x+5)\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3) & =(6-2x)\\operatorname{ln}⁡(7) \\\\ x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)+5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3) & =6\\operatorname{ln}⁡(7)-2x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(7) \\\\ x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)+2x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(7) & =6\\operatorname{ln}⁡(7)-5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3) \\\\ x(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)+2\\operatorname{ln}⁡(7)) & =6\\operatorname{ln}⁡(7)-5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3) \\\\ x & =\\frac{6\\operatorname{ln}⁡(7)-5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)+2\\operatorname{ln}⁡(7)}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533789 true] [17592186251253 1000 #edb/ref 17592186251254 13194139533789 true] [17592186251253 1000 #edb/ref 17592186251255 13194139533789 true] [17592186251253 1000 #edb/ref 17592186251256 13194139533789 true] [17592186251253 1000 #edb/ref 17592186251257 13194139533789 true] [17592186251253 1000 #edb/ref 17592186251258 13194139533789 true] [17592186251253 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533789 true] [17592186251253 1041 "selection" 13194139533789 true] [17592186251253 1104 #edb/ref 17592186251254 13194139533789 true] [17592186251253 1110 #uuid "c979e788-3ee6-5ed6-84ca-e4c387d73cb9" 13194139533789 true] [17592186251254 1034 "\\frac{6\\operatorname{ln}⁡(7)-5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)+2\\operatorname{ln}⁡(7)}" 13194139533789 true] [17592186251254 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533789 true] [17592186251254 1111 #uuid "d0407ab3-02ee-5e73-8d86-bbe7c19dd12a" 13194139533789 true] [17592186251255 1034 "\\frac{6\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)+5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(7)}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(7)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)}" 13194139533789 true] [17592186251255 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533789 true] [17592186251255 1111 #uuid "4595fedc-25f7-57f2-a34c-c7c330f1d7d3" 13194139533789 true] [17592186251256 1034 "\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)+2\\operatorname{ln}⁡(7)}" 13194139533789 true] [17592186251256 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533789 true] [17592186251256 1111 #uuid "1eb77a6c-56e4-503c-a9ab-a187512f6a1a" 13194139533789 true] [17592186251257 1034 "\\frac{1}{6\\op